NSE replay fixtures for tests/test_relations.py and tests/test_nse_india.py.

real/  Trimmed REAL responses, fetched live on 2026-10-05 (about 16:00-16:30 UTC) through the
       collectors' own session (scripts/nse.py). Only rows were dropped; every kept row and
       field is as NSE served it (JSON re-serialised with indentation; CSVs keep their original
       lines; XBRL files are whole and unmodified). Replay with --today 2026-10-05.
       File (replay name)                              Source URL (www.nseindia.com/api/... unless noted)
